markdown <<MARKDOWN
<h1>Section 2: What Is Machine Learning?</h1>

<div style="display: inline-block; background-color: #E4E2F8; color: #1F1976; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Aligns to curriculum Lessons 1-2</div>

<p>This section prepares you to teach two curriculum lessons. Students have just spent an entire unit writing explicit rules for a computer to follow. This section flips that completely: now the computer learns patterns from data instead of being told what to do, step by step.</p>

<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
  <div style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;"><b>Curriculum Lesson 1:</b> What is Machine Learning?</div>
  <a href="PASTE_UNIT_2_LESSON_1_URL_HERE" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px;">View Curriculum Lesson 1</a>
</div>

<div style="background-color: #F7F7FB; border-left: 4px solid #4C42CF; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
  <div style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;"><b>Curriculum Lesson 2:</b> Handling Uncertainty</div>
  <a href="PASTE_UNIT_2_LESSON_2_URL_HERE" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; margin-top: 6px; font-size: 13px;">View Curriculum Lesson 2</a>
</div>

<hr>

<p><b>In this section, you'll:</b></p>
<div style="margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 16px;">&bull; Get clear on the real distinction between machine learning and the logic-based AI from Unit 1</div>
<div style="margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 16px;">&bull; Get ahead of a subtle misconception: "the computer learned on its own" can quietly overstate what's actually happening</div>
<div style="margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 16px;">&bull; Walk through probability as a concept, then trace Python's <code>random</code> module in action</div>
<div style="font-size: 16px;">&bull; Get ahead of common probability misconceptions students bring with them before this lesson even starts</div>

<div style="background-color: #E4E2F8; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 16px 0;">
  <div style="font-size: 16px; color: #222222; line-height: 1.5;"><b>&#128161; Notice as you explore:</b> this section's two lessons don't feel connected at first, ML concepts, then probability, but probability is the actual mathematical language models use to express uncertainty. It's not a detour.</div>
</div>

<hr>

<div style="display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-top: 24px; max-width: 700px;">
  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #ACA8EA; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px;">Section 1</div>
  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px;">Section 2</div>
  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #ACA8EA; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1.5px solid #E4E2F8;">Section 3</div>
  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #ACA8EA; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1.5px solid #E4E2F8;">Section 4</div>
  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #ACA8EA; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1.5px solid #E4E2F8;">Section 5</div>
  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #ACA8EA; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1.5px solid #E4E2F8;">Section 6</div>
  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #ACA8EA; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1.5px solid #E4E2F8;">Section 7</div>
